{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0095-s001", "text": "Vardera maken har rätt att själv besluta om sitt deltagande i förvärvsarbete samt i samhällelig och annan verksamhet utanför familjen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0095-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.77251700680272, "peak": 0.331573486328125, "generation_seconds": 23.866519012022763, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0096-s001", "text": "Vardera maken ska efter förmåga bidra till familjens gemensamma hushåll och makarnas underhåll.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0096-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.150204081632653, "peak": 0.468017578125, "generation_seconds": 14.214846432907507, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0096-s002", "text": "Om den ena maken inte förvärvsarbetar ska den förmögnare maken stå för kostnader för till exempel mat och kläder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0096-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.822040816326531, "peak": 0.315399169921875, "generation_seconds": 15.6948825949803, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0097-s001", "text": "Enligt lagen har varje människa sexuell självbestämmanderätt i äktenskapet och alla parförhållanden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0097-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.916462585034013, "peak": 0.4736328125, "generation_seconds": 12.093881878070533, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0097-s002", "text": "Om en person tvingar en annan till könsumgänge, är det fråga om våldtäkt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0097-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.313232421875, "generation_seconds": 11.315439604921266, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0097-s003", "text": "Det är ett brott i äktenskapet och också utanför det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0097-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.347991943359375, "generation_seconds": 11.40684952097945, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0097-s004", "text": "Också våld i parrelationer är ett brott i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0097-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.331329345703125, "generation_seconds": 14.757715185871348, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0097-s005", "text": "Man får aldrig slå eller skada sin make på något sätt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0097-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.015510204081632, "peak": 0.335540771484375, "generation_seconds": 13.089243094902486, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0098-s001", "text": "Man har rätt att få information om sin makes hälsotillstånd av till exempel en läkare endast med makens samtycke.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0098-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.891700680272109, "peak": 0.330657958984375, "generation_seconds": 31.007689245976508, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0098-s002", "text": "En make kan bestämma om sin mans eller hustrus vård endast under exceptionella omständigheter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0098-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.297119140625, "generation_seconds": 20.665141822071746, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0099-s001", "text": "Makarna i ett äktenskap kan ha gemensam egendom, men också egen egendom.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0099-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.339047619047619, "peak": 0.329681396484375, "generation_seconds": 15.632089876104146, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0099-s002", "text": "Den ena maken kan till exempel inte sälja den andra makens egendom.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0099-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.28533935546875, "generation_seconds": 16.035894046071917, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0099-s003", "text": "Den ena maken kan inte heller sälja det gemensamma hemmet eller lösöre utan den andras lov.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0099-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.27685546875, "generation_seconds": 12.52833625418134, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0100-s001", "text": "Vardera maken ansvarar ensam för den skuld som de har tagit före äktenskapet eller under det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0100-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.2861328125, "generation_seconds": 13.077506739879027, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0100-s002", "text": "Om den ena maken har tagit lån för att försörja familjen, till exempel för att köpa mat, ansvarar båda makarna för denna skuld.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0100-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.145578231292516, "peak": 0.39422607421875, "generation_seconds": 17.73126021004282, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0100-s003", "text": "Om makarna vill, kan de åta sig gemensamma skulder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0100-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.27728271484375, "generation_seconds": 8.497587980004027, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0100-s004", "text": "Då måste de också återbetala skulderna tillsammans.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0100-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.73687074829932, "peak": 0.282806396484375, "generation_seconds": 7.534560966072604, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0101-s001", "text": "Makarnas ekonomiska ställning sinsemellan tryggas genom giftorätten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0101-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.3245849609375, "generation_seconds": 8.893877405906096, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0101-s002", "text": "Giftorätt betyder att makarnas hela egendom räknas ihop och delas på hälften mellan båda vid en skilsmässa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0101-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.2786865234375, "generation_seconds": 17.13735596695915, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0101-s003", "text": "Om den ena maken dör, räknas den döda makens och änkans eller änklingens egendomar ihop och delas före arvskiftet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0101-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.682721088435374, "peak": 0.444549560546875, "generation_seconds": 14.197945726802573, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0101-s004", "text": "Giftorätten kan inte upphävas genom testamente, men den kan upphävas eller begränsas med ett äktenskapsförord.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0101-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.404081632653062, "peak": 0.30682373046875, "generation_seconds": 13.923060264904052, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0102-s001", "text": "Giftorätten träder i kraft först när ett äktenskap upphör.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0102-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.363809523809524, "peak": 0.3380126953125, "generation_seconds": 7.695214353967458, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0102-s002", "text": "Under äktenskapet hör en egendom till den make i vars namn den står.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0102-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.23358154296875, "generation_seconds": 7.850045090075582, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0102-s003", "text": "Makarna är ändå skyldiga att förvalta den egendom som omfattas av giftorätten på ett sådant sätt att dess värde inte minskar i onödan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0102-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.842176870748299, "peak": 0.292327880859375, "generation_seconds": 15.624767761910334, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0103-s001", "text": "Om makarna vill hålla sina egendomar åtskilda, kan de upprätta ett äktenskapsförord.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0103-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.732244897959184, "peak": 0.281829833984375, "generation_seconds": 10.373940650839359, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0103-s002", "text": "I ett äktenskapsförord kan man avtala om att giftorätten inte gäller eller att den till exempel gäller endast en del av makarnas egendom.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0103-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.77251700680272, "peak": 0.281341552734375, "generation_seconds": 20.80164841702208, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0103-s003", "text": "Med ett äktenskapsförord kommer makarna alltså överens om hur deras egendom ska delas om den ena dör eller det blir skilsmässa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0103-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.075918367346938, "peak": 0.30889892578125, "generation_seconds": 18.18989619007334, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0104-s001", "text": "Äktenskapsförord är frivilligt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0104-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.3436734693877552, "peak": 0.3446044921875, "generation_seconds": 6.492183979135007, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0104-s002", "text": "Med äktenskapsförord kan makarna utesluta giftorätten till den andras egendom antingen helt eller delvis om de skiljer sig eller om den ena av makarna dör.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0104-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.235374149659863, "peak": 0.37030029296875, "generation_seconds": 25.631754911970347, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0104-s003", "text": "Äktenskapsförord kan upprättas före äktenskapet eller under det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0104-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.320770263671875, "generation_seconds": 12.432294514030218, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0104-s004", "text": "Båda makarna ska underteckna äktenskapsförordet och två ojäviga vittnen ska vidimera underskrifterna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0104-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.05578231292517, "peak": 0.30865478515625, "generation_seconds": 18.403870896901935, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0104-s005", "text": "För att äktenskapsförordet ska träda i kraft, måste det registreras hos Myndigheten för digitalisering och befolkningsdata.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0104-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.727619047619047, "peak": 0.443359375, "generation_seconds": 22.269421516917646, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0105-s001", "text": "Vanligtvis delas egendomen vid skilsmässa jämnt mellan makarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0105-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.261199951171875, "generation_seconds": 14.105070272926241, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0105-s002", "text": "I undantagsfall delas egendomen inte jämnt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0105-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.900952380952381, "peak": 0.30419921875, "generation_seconds": 10.219323607860133, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0105-s003", "text": "Då kan bodelningen jämkas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0105-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.647074829931973, "peak": 0.338623046875, "generation_seconds": 8.10401735897176, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0105-s004", "text": "Detta betyder att man i situationen beaktar vad som är rimligt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0105-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.263336181640625, "generation_seconds": 8.302133058896288, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0105-s005", "text": "Om äktenskapet till exempel har varat under fem år delas egendomen inte nödvändigtvis jämnt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0105-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.2857666015625, "generation_seconds": 9.902765009086579, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0106-s001", "text": "Bodelningen kan jämkas endast om någon av makarna separat kräver det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-makar/narration/hb-c09-u0106-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.339047619047619, "peak": 0.288970947265625, "generation_seconds": 8.027559843845665, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
